<title>USA: Casmyn Corp sees higher gold production.</title>
<headline>Casmyn Corp sees higher gold production.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casmyn Corp said Monday it is expecting a substantial increase in gold production from its 100 percent owned Turk Mine in Zimbabwe as a result of the completion of its Phase I, U.S. $12 million plant expansion.</p>
<p>The Phase I expansion is geared towards increasing the gold output from the mine to a level of 40,000 ounces per year.</p>
